# When the React app is opened on another device but the FastAPI + SQLite “storage laptop” is elsewhere,
# set this to that machine’s LAN URL (must include port 8000). Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.42:8000
#
# Or leave unset and open the UI from http://<storage-laptop-ip>:3000 so the browser hostname matches the API host.
#
# Runtime override (no rebuild): in the browser console on any device:
#   localStorage.setItem('airhelp_api_base', 'http://192.168.1.42:8000')
